# Design sources: large, frequently re-saved binaries bloat git history
# permanently and cannot be diffed. Exported PNGs are tracked instead.
*.psd
# The 11MB footer master. The build reads the optimised public/footer-landscape.jpg,
# so the source only ever costs the repo size.
Design/footer_image_m.jpg

# Enrichment intermediates. verify-and-enrich.ts writes the employers' full
# descriptions here (41 MB) and the roles we don't carry; the build reads them
# and the TRIMMED result is what gets committed, inside curated-jobs.json and
# snapshot.json. Keeping the raw capture out of git keeps the repo clonable.
src/lib/generated/job-content.json
src/lib/generated/job-content-generic.json
src/lib/generated/unreachable-descriptions.json
src/lib/generated/discovered-roles.json
